{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "交出控制权",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 145.41,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句话的定义。",
   "spoken": "先给一句话的定义。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.28,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "合约在更新自己的账本之前，把控制权交给了外部地址。",
   "spoken": "合约在更新自己的账本之前，把控制权交给了外部地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.1,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 4.198,
   "speechEnd": 8.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "外部地址趁账本还是旧的，再次调用合约。",
   "spoken": "外部地址趁账本还是旧的，再次掉用合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.36,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 9.458,
   "speechEnd": 12.898
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "严格来说，重入是一个函数还没执行完，就被外部调用再次进入。",
   "spoken": "严格来说，虫入是一个函数还没执行完，就被外部掉用再次进入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.948,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 14.046,
   "speechEnd": 19.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方。你去银行取 100 元。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。你去银航取 100 元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.384,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 20.482,
   "speechEnd": 23.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "柜员先把现金递给你，然后才去改账本。",
   "spoken": "柜员先把现金递给你，然后才去改账本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.372,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 24.47,
   "speechEnd": 27.541
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "你接过现金的瞬间，同伴在旁边说：他要再取 100 元。",
   "spoken": "你接过现金的瞬间，同伴在旁边说：他要再取 100 元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.6,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 28.698,
   "speechEnd": 32.876
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "柜员一查，账本上还是 100，于是又给了一次。",
   "spoken": "柜员一查，账本上还是 100，于是又给了一次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.932,
   "dur": 4.776,
   "speechStart": 34.03,
   "speechEnd": 37.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "只要柜员一直先给钱、后改账，你们就能一直取，直到金库见底。",
   "spoken": "只要柜员一直先给钱、后改账，你们就能一直取，直到金库见底。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.928,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 39.026,
   "speechEnd": 44.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。现实里，柜员可以同时接待两个人。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。现实里，柜员可以同时接待两个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 45.388,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 45.486,
   "speechEnd": 50.959
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "EVM 是单线程的。重入不是并发，而是嵌套。",
   "spoken": "EVM 是单线程的。虫入不是并发，而是嵌套。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 52.016,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 52.114,
   "speechEnd": 56.73
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第二次取款，整个发生在第一次取款的中间。",
   "spoken": "第二次取款，整个发生在第一次取款的中间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 57.804,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 57.902,
   "speechEnd": 61.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "所以，重入的前提只有两个。",
   "spoken": "所以，虫入的前提只有两个。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 62.104,
   "dur": 3.24,
   "speechStart": 62.202,
   "speechEnd": 64.511
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第一，合约在函数中途发起外部调用，而被调用的一方，受攻击者控制。",
   "spoken": "第一，合约在函数中途发起外部掉用，而被掉用的一方，受攻击者控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 65.564,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 65.662,
   "speechEnd": 71.9
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "第二，外部调用发生的时候，合约的状态，还没有更新到最终值。",
   "spoken": "第二，外部掉用发生的时候，合约的状态，还没有更新到最终值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 72.96,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 73.058,
   "speechEnd": 78.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "哪些操作会交出控制权？一共有六类。",
   "spoken": "哪些操作会交出控制权？一共有六类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 79.324,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 79.422,
   "speechEnd": 82.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "用 call 转 ETH。接收方是合约时，会执行它的 receive，或者 fallback。",
   "spoken": "用 call 转 ETH。接收方是合约时，会执行它的 receive，或者 fallback。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 83.864,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 83.962,
   "speechEnd": 89.864
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "调用代币的 transfer。代币如果是攻击者部署的，里面的代码可以是任意的。",
   "spoken": "掉用代币的 transfer。代币如果是攻击者部署的，里面的代码可以是任意的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 90.924,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 91.022,
   "speechEnd": 96.841
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "ERC-777 代币转账，会触发接收方的钩子。",
   "spoken": "ERC-777 代币转账，会触发接收方的钩子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 97.888,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 97.986,
   "speechEnd": 101.545
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "NFT 的安全转账和安全铸造，会回调接收方。",
   "spoken": "NFT 的安全转账和安全铸造，会回掉接收方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 102.596,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 102.694,
   "speechEnd": 106.551
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "闪电贷的回调，设计上就是把控制权交给借款人。",
   "spoken": "闪电贷的回掉，设计上就是把控制权交给借款人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 107.616,
   "dur": 4.824,
   "speechStart": 107.714,
   "speechEnd": 111.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "还有，调用任何用户提供的地址，包括路由器、钩子和预言机。",
   "spoken": "还有，掉用任何用户提供的地址，包括路由器、钩子和预言机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 112.66,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 112.758,
   "speechEnd": 118.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "再补一个细节。同一份代码，换一条链，回调入口就不一样。",
   "spoken": "再补一个细节。同一份代码，换一条链，回掉入口就不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 119.36,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 119.458,
   "speechEnd": 124.324
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，用系统交易转 TRX，不会执行接收合约的 fallback。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，用系统交易转 TRX，不会执行接收合约的 fallback。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 125.364,
   "dur": 5.928,
   "speechStart": 125.462,
   "speechEnd": 130.462
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "附带 callValue 去调用合约，才会执行。",
   "spoken": "附带 callValue 去掉用合约，才会执行。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-24.mp3",
   "start": 131.512,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 131.61,
   "speechEnd": 134.288
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "在 Mantle 上，ETH 以 ERC-20 的形式存在，转它不触发 receive。转原生币 MNT，才会触发。",
   "spoken": "在 Mantle 上，ETH 以 ERC-20 的形式存在，转它不触发 receive。转原生币 MNT，才会触发。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg2-25.mp3",
   "start": 135.356,
   "dur": 8.856,
   "speechStart": 135.454,
   "speechEnd": 143.368
  }
